  "question": {
    "text": "A line with direction ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math> meets the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> respectively at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>. if the length of the perpendicular from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>)</mo></math> to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "65",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DR</mi><mo>'</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0071_c4fd8a7a4c25.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 146px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>AF</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>PQ</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AF</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>65</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p>"
  }
